WEBVTT

00:20:58.344 --> 00:21:00.222
more than, or 95 percent of your wealth,

00:21:00.222 --> 00:21:02.117
will be given to the foundation.

00:21:02.117 --> 00:21:03.271
BG: Yes.

00:21:03.271 --> 00:21:07.020
CA: And since this relationship, it's amazing—

00:21:07.020 --> 00:21:10.386
(Applause)

00:21:10.386 --> 00:21:13.023
And recently, you and Warren

00:21:13.023 --> 00:21:14.903
have been going around trying to persuade

00:21:14.903 --> 00:21:16.879
other billionaires and successful people

00:21:16.879 --> 00:21:18.402
to pledge to give, what,

00:21:18.402 --> 00:21:24.160
more than half of their assets for philanthropy.

00:21:24.160 --> 00:21:26.575
How is that going?

00:21:26.575 --> 00:21:29.747
BG: Well, we've got about 120 people

00:21:29.747 --> 00:21:32.185
who have now taken this giving pledge.